<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Elohim, Jehovah, the Triune God,</l><l>Father God, who calls you through faith in His Word,</l><l>Holy Breath, dispensing, now is Jesus the Son,</l><l>All-inclusive, Three-in-One.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Jesus is Jehovah, the Great I Am,</l><l>Jesus Christ the Savior: perfect, sinless man;</l><l>Jesus as the “I Am” is all we need,</l><l>On this living person we feed.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Jesus is Jehovah, full reality,</l><l>The eternal “To Be” who sets us free,</l><l>We by faith confessing, Lord, we believe,</l><l>Father God, be worshipped and well-pleased.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
